{"id":"geneva","name":"日内瓦","en":"Geneva","country":"Switzerland","lat":46.2,"lng":6.15,"dek":"湖与罗讷河交会处，一座以克制著称的国际城。","history":"日内瓦最早见于凯撒的《高卢战记》。公元前58年，凯撒率军在此阻止赫尔维蒂人渡过罗讷河，当时的聚落名唤Genava。罗马人把它经营成山北高卢的一座前哨，依着河港生长。公元4世纪中叶，城市出现第一座基督教堂。443年，勃艮第人进驻，将日内瓦设为首都；二十余年后政治中心迁往里昂。此后数百年，主教、日内瓦伯爵与远方的神圣罗马帝国势力反复角力，城市在权力夹缝中筑起防御工事，慢慢收缩为一处紧凑的中世纪聚落。\n\n宗教改革给日内瓦留下一道最深的刻痕。1536年，让·加尔文抵达日内瓦，与纪尧姆·法雷尔等人一同把它变成归正宗运动的中心，后人多称其为“新教的罗马”。1559年，加尔文创办日内瓦大学，学术与神学在此相互加固。1553年，西班牙神学家塞尔韦特因否认三位一体在日内瓦被处火刑，留下这座城市在信仰与宽容之间长久无法抹去的阴影。\n\n1602年12月11日夜，萨伏依军队翻墙袭击日内瓦，被市民击退。这场“登城事件”成为城市独立的象征，至今每年仍被纪念。此后大批法国新教徒涌入，带来资本、技艺与贸易网络，丝绸、镀金和钟表业随之兴起。1864年，保护战地伤患的第一部日内瓦公约在此签订。1919年之后，国际联盟选定日内瓦为总部，万国宫拔地而起，这座曾以神学与工匠闻名的城市，开始被世界称为谈判桌与会议厅的所在。","culture":"日内瓦的文化气质里，有一种奇特的私密与公开并存。老城建在坡上，石巷窄而陡，圣彼得大教堂地下埋着前罗马时代的考古层；而在湖滨，一柱大喷泉毫无遮掩地喷至一百四十米，风大时水雾打湿半边码头。市民在湖里游泳，在旧城安静地开店，又习惯了万国宫外不同语言的脚步。它既不属于热闹的度假地，也不完全是冷硬的行政中心。\n\n城市也珍惜自己的反叛者与思想者。卢梭1712年出生于此，1762年，他的《爱弥儿》和《社会契约论》在市政厅前被公开焚毁，两百年后，他的名字被刻进城市记忆。改革家加尔文、语言学家索绪尔、观念史家斯塔罗宾斯基，都在日内瓦留下痕迹。这里不急于表达，却一直有争论的传统。","pull":"在新教的罗马，连湖水都保持着一种冷静的高度。","sights":[{"name":"大喷泉","orig":"Jet d'Eau","intro":"日内瓦最醒目的标志之一。水柱从罗讷河出湖处射至一百四十米高，城中的许多地方都能望见。它最初只是水利设施的压力释放装置，1891年才成为固定喷泉。夜间有灯光照明，近距离会完全被水雾打湿。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Jet_d%27eau_de_Gen%C3%A8ve_%28swiss%29.jpg/960px-Jet_d%27eau_de_Gen%C3%A8ve_%28swiss%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1440},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jet_d'Eau"},{"name":"圣彼得大教堂","orig":"Cathédrale Saint-Pierre","intro":"位于老城最高处，原为天主教主教座堂，宗教改革后成为加尔文传统的核心空间。游客可沿着陡峭石阶登上塔楼，望见湖与城市。地下考古层一直追溯到罗曼时期以前，是理解日内瓦城市源起的好入口。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Fa%C3%A7ade_de_la_cath%C3%A9drale_Saint-Pierre_de_Gen%C3%A8ve_2009-07-11.jpg/960px-Fa%C3%A7ade_de_la_cath%C3%A9drale_Saint-Pierre_de_Gen%C3%A8ve_2009-07-11.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":886},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E5%BD%BC%E5%BE%97%E5%A4%A7%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82_(%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E7%93%A6)"},{"name":"万国宫","orig":"Palais des Nations","intro":"最初为国际联盟而建，如今是联合国日内瓦办事处所在地。参观需跟随导览进入，核心看点是大会厅、公共艺术收藏和开阔的庭园。入口在Appia门，需提前经过安检。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/UN_Building_A_Southern_Lawn.jpg/960px-UN_Building_A_Southern_Lawn.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%AB"},{"name":"老城","orig":"Vieille Ville","intro":"环抱圣彼得大教堂的旧城区，街巷窄而陡，适合慢慢步行。看点包括市政厅、卢梭出生地以及橱窗里各色旧物店。对于行动不便的人，坡道可能是个挑战。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Place_du_Bourg-de-Four_in_Geneva_old_town.jpg/960px-Place_du_Bourg-de-Four_in_Geneva_old_town.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"艺术与历史博物馆","orig":"Musée d'Art et d'Histoire","intro":"日内瓦规模较大的综合性博物馆，收藏覆盖考古、美术与应用艺术。馆藏与城市历史联系紧密，尤其适合想了解日内瓦在宗教改革、手工业与国际交往中留下的物质记忆的人。","img":null,"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"日内瓦牛排","orig":"Entrecôte genevoise","intro":"日内瓦餐馆里常见的一道做法：薄切牛排配浓稠的黄油酱，常带白葡萄酒香，再配薯条与生菜。做法不张扬，但酱汁是判断一家本地餐馆水平的常用尺度。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"湖畔鳟鱼","orig":"Filet de féra du Léman","intro":"莱芒湖出产的一种白鱼，通常以黄油煎或白葡萄酒蒸。湖滨餐馆把它当作日内瓦风土最直接的表达，做法轻，肉质细。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/F%C3%A9ra_du_L%C3%A9man_-_collection_d%27animaux_disparus%2C_Mus%C3%A9e_de_zoologie_de_Lausanne.jpg/960px-F%C3%A9ra_du_L%C3%A9man_-_collection_d%27animaux_disparus%2C_Mus%C3%A9e_de_zoologie_de_Lausanne.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":579},"src":null},{"name":"帕基斯火锅","orig":"Fondue de Genève","intro":"湖中贝恩德帕基斯的木板湖畔小馆，冬天供应传统奶酪火锅。白面包块浸入混合奶酪，气氛与湖风一样直接。夏秋则改成简餐和游泳客的歇脚处。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Fondue_dish.jpg/960px-Fondue_dish.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%9D%E5%A3%AB%E7%81%AB%E9%8D%8B"},{"name":"瑞士葡萄酒","orig":"Vin de Genève","intro":"日内瓦州是瑞士葡萄酒产区之一，主打轻盈的白葡萄酒与果味清晰的红葡萄酒。本地餐馆常供杯装，配湖鱼或奶酪都合适，是这座法语城市餐桌上的安静底色。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/Ch_vins.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":642},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%91%9E%E5%A3%AB%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E9%85%92"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Geneva_from_Mount_Sal%C3%A8ve.jpg/1280px-Geneva_from_Mount_Sal%C3%A8ve.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":350},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Palais_des_Nations_unies%2C_%C3%A0_Gen%C3%A8ve.jpg/1280px-Palais_des_Nations_unies%2C_%C3%A0_Gen%C3%A8ve.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":1024}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[6.1102325,46.205568],[6.1119671,46.1969295],[6.1215616,46.1976094],[6.1215455,46.196122],[6.1234424,46.1958432],[6.1273684,46.1970975],[6.1276465,46.1877695],[6.1350187,46.190844],[6.1370058,46.1888105],[6.1414365,46.1890817],[6.1439132,46.1869351],[6.1530848,46.1864411],[6.1545275,46.1847061],[6.1538265,46.1798406],[6.1567223,46.1777907],[6.1594738,46.1788529],[6.162972,46.1876802],[6.1650454,46.1881794],[6.167864,46.1872657],[6.1673676,46.1898652],[6.1725907,46.1938074],[6.1712379,46.1945059],[6.1758225,46.2013319],[6.1733903,46.2029559],[6.1758454,46.2057866],[6.174876,46.207026],[6.1717302,46.2058825],[6.1707542,46.2066977],[6.173282,46.2095996],[6.1713781,46.2110569],[6.1723617,46.2118914],[6.1619003,46.2152237],[6.1667005,46.2244668],[6.1489408,46.2277922],[6.143428,46.2306363],[6.1428643,46.2293],[6.1385325,46.230292],[6.1388163,46.2287503],[6.1379433,46.2281813],[6.1363395,46.2303566],[6.1330741,46.2318859],[6.128258,46.2285336],[6.1286106,46.2279786],[6.1257816,46.2273483],[6.1242203,46.2257319],[6.1218883,46.2267062],[6.1212101,46.2259754],[6.121754,46.2248401],[6.1138317,46.2202734],[6.1162534,46.2175648],[6.1192544,46.2162085],[6.1102325,46.205568]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-v4-pro","wiki":{"zh":"日内瓦","en":"Geneva","voyage":"Geneva"}}}